    <name>VI-13 · North Island 1000</name>
    <desc>The best concentrated Island BDR-style loop, joining remote north-Island communities with serious fuel and communication planning. Road geometry derived from OpenStreetMap contributors under ODbL; route selection is an independently authored research overview. Verify land access, closures, gates, weather and field signage.</desc>
